{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51271","headline":"殷十一赠栗冈砚 · 李白","name":"殷十一赠栗冈砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷侯三玄士，赠我栗冈砚。\n洒染中山毫，光映吴门练。\n天寒水不冻，日用心不倦。\n携此临墨池，还如对君面。\n（高似孙《砚笺》四）（见宋初吴淑《事类赋》卷十五，「光映」作「光辉」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}